Update src/types/index.ts to add the RenderEngine interface and CardSide union type.

Add these types:
```typescript
interface RenderEngine {
  render(data: any, target: HTMLElement): void
  precompute?(data: any): Promise<void>
}

type CardSide = string | { data: any; renderEngineId: string }
```

Update the Card interface so front and back use CardSide instead of string:
```typescript
interface Card {
  id: string;
  front: CardSide;
  back: CardSide;
}
```

Keep all existing types (LearningMode, Theme, SessionResult) unchanged.
Export the new types (RenderEngine, CardSide) alongside existing exports.

Reference: apps/flashcards/docs/how/architecture.md — Key Types section
